# Marketing site only (apps/site). Read at build time, not by the API or the signed-in app.
# Optional Google Tag Manager container id. Leave this unset. A self-hosted or default build must
# not send visitors to Glideworth's Google account. The official production deploy sets it.
# Format: GTM- followed by letters and digits. Anything else is ignored and the tag is not loaded.
# PUBLIC_GTM_ID=
